# Fetched by fetch.py rather than committed — 49 KB and 428 KB respectively, and the repository
# already declines to carry potrace's binary and the mediapipe weights for the same reason.
# `SimpleSkin.gltf` is 3.5 KB and IS committed, so the reader tests always assert something.
RiggedFigure.glb
CesiumMan.glb

# Written fresh by MeshGltfTests on every run — a minimal textured quad whose texture coordinates
# the test specifies, so the UV-flip check never depends on a fetched fixture.
_*.gltf
